From 4d689a3c7b2b71b95e76e1d6ccaa1751b2645e85 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: HDR Builder <hdr-builder@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 14:29:06 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] animation: own synthetic tiling transitions outside Shell
 size effects

Preserve snapshot crossfade and geometry easing with extension-owned records, freeze accounting and transition identities. Observe native signals only to cancel synthetic work and avoid pending effects; never prepare or complete a compositor-owned size effect. Cancel rapid retiles and disable cleanly; leave delayed Wayland clients thawed.
